WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.930
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02.200 --> 00:04.720
[Kazamino High School]

3
00:12.970 --> 00:15.380
- Oh my gosh! - He's so hot!

4
00:23.120 --> 00:24.880
Hioki.

5
00:42.370 --> 00:44.300
In my second year of high school,

6
00:44.300 --> 00:47.820
I was placed into a class with none of my friends.

7
00:47.820 --> 00:51.820
But during our school trip, I joined a group I wasn't close to,

8
00:51.820 --> 00:55.700
and eventually, started dating my first ever significant other.

9
00:56.900 --> 01:00.630
Two months have passed since our relationship began.

10
01:07.060 --> 01:11.650
We've gone from second, to third years.

11
01:11.650 --> 01:13.260
Watarai.

12
01:13.260 --> 01:14.720
Don't leave me behind.

13
01:14.720 --> 01:18.130
Sorry. I wanted to see Hioki as soon as possible.

14
01:18.130 --> 01:21.070
Watarai and Morisaki were placed in Class 5.

15
01:21.070 --> 01:23.050
You see each other every day.

16
01:23.050 --> 01:26.440
Let's go, Hioki. I'm starving.

17
01:26.440 --> 01:29.230
Hotta and Nakasato, Class 3.

18
01:30.290 --> 01:31.960
And I was placed in Class 2.

19
01:31.960 --> 01:35.480
Hioki! Don't leave me behind!

20
01:35.480 --> 01:37.470
Woah, look. A bombshell beauty.

21
01:37.470 --> 01:39.410
- A beauty? Where? - Let's go.

22
01:39.410 --> 01:41.730
Yeah.

23
01:41.730 --> 01:45.800
Though we're no longer in the same class,

24
01:45.800 --> 01:49.930
we still continue to stick together.

25
01:56.410 --> 01:58.550
Go, go!

26
01:58.550 --> 02:00.270
Oh my gosh!

27
02:00.270 --> 02:02.570
There he is!

28
02:02.570 --> 02:04.670
What's he doing here?

29
02:11.610 --> 02:13.940
He looks so hot...

30
02:15.630 --> 02:16.890
What's up?

31
02:16.890 --> 02:18.950
Sorry to bother you during practice.

32
02:18.950 --> 02:23.590
Could we walk home together?

33
02:23.590 --> 02:24.620
Sure.

34
02:24.620 --> 02:28.690
Two months have passed since we started dating.

35
02:29.800 --> 02:31.710
I still have an hour of practice though.

36
02:31.710 --> 02:33.590
That's fine.

37
02:33.590 --> 02:35.820
I'll wait however long it takes.

38
02:38.120 --> 02:39.900
I'm your boyfriend, after all.

39
02:44.030 --> 02:46.730
Nothing's really changed between us.

40
02:47.400 --> 02:52.170
You look cool, playing badminton.

41
02:57.150 --> 02:58.940
Love you.

42
03:00.190 --> 03:01.880
Woah, hey.

43
03:01.880 --> 03:03.800
Not at school.

44
03:03.800 --> 03:07.750
Then it's fine if we're not at school?

45
03:07.750 --> 03:10.700
Yeah. Of course.

46
03:10.700 --> 03:13.110
- How far am I allowed to go? - Huh?

47
03:16.920 --> 03:19.130
Since I'm your boyfriend,

48
03:19.130 --> 03:21.270
does that mean I can have my way with you?

49
03:28.650 --> 03:31.200
Just kidding.

50
03:31.200 --> 03:34.360
Good luck with practice.

51
03:37.120 --> 03:40.020
Hey! Hioki!

52
03:40.020 --> 03:43.720
Quit flirting with the hottie, and get back here!

53
03:43.720 --> 03:46.080
I'll be right there as soon as I'm done.

54
03:46.080 --> 03:48.110
Sounds good. I'll be waiting.

55
03:48.110 --> 03:50.620
Was that a promise I heard?

56
03:50.620 --> 03:55.060
Come on, get practicing!

57
03:57.990 --> 04:00.930
How's the new class?

58
04:03.360 --> 04:06.630
It's been fun, especially with Tsujitani there.

59
04:06.630 --> 04:09.490
- I see. - Yeah.

60
04:09.490 --> 04:11.390
So everything's okay?

61
04:11.390 --> 04:13.570
No weirdos are trying to sidle up to you?

62
04:13.570 --> 04:14.830
Huh?

63
04:14.830 --> 04:19.810
No one's getting overly close or touchy, right?

64
04:19.810 --> 04:21.970
What? No.

65
04:21.970 --> 04:24.150
Is there anyone like me around?

66
04:24.150 --> 04:25.620
No, definitely not.

67
04:25.620 --> 04:28.940
You're way too worried about me.

68
04:28.940 --> 04:33.010
I can't help it. You're too cute.

69
04:33.010 --> 04:35.530
Well, uh...

70
04:35.530 --> 04:39.070
You're probably the only one who thinks that.

71
04:41.040 --> 04:43.060
Then I guess that's fine.

72
04:55.340 --> 04:57.240
- Oh yeah. - Huh?

73
04:57.240 --> 04:59.360
Will you be attending that, too?

74
05:05.350 --> 05:08.780
Where'd I put it...

75
05:08.780 --> 05:10.680
There it is.

76
05:12.800 --> 05:14.370
This.

77
05:15.570 --> 05:18.030
The study camp? [STUDY BASE]

78
05:18.810 --> 05:22.360
Yeah. I'm thinking of signing up for it.

79
05:22.360 --> 05:26.450
I go wherever you go. Count me in.

80
05:30.270 --> 05:34.430
By the way, have you decided what college you'll be going to?

81
05:35.220 --> 05:37.470
Not yet.

82
05:37.470 --> 05:40.790
I'm fine enrolling wherever if you're there.

83
05:40.790 --> 05:44.300
You should think about it a bit harder than that.

84
05:44.300 --> 05:47.520
I'm excited for this study camp.

85
05:47.520 --> 05:51.350
- It reminds me of the school trip. - Same.

86
05:53.040 --> 05:55.760
I hope I'll get to share a bed with you.

87
05:55.760 --> 05:58.350
You're asking the impossible...

88
05:58.350 --> 06:00.770
What? You don't want to sleep together?

89
06:00.770 --> 06:04.080
I mean, I'd want to stay with you, too.

90
06:04.080 --> 06:05.350
But, our classes.

91
06:05.350 --> 06:06.970
I'll figure something out.

92
06:06.970 --> 06:08.970
No, you won't.

93
06:10.480 --> 06:12.260
I can't wait.

94
06:12.260 --> 06:13.900
Sitting on the bus together,

95
06:13.900 --> 06:16.020
eating together,

96
06:16.780 --> 06:18.370
bathing together...

97
06:18.370 --> 06:20.270
Focus on studying.

98
06:20.270 --> 06:21.910
I will.

99
06:21.910 --> 06:26.620
But I only care about being with you.

100
06:26.620 --> 06:31.860
This year will bring plenty more unforgettable memories.

101
06:31.860 --> 06:33.820
You really should study.

102
07:33.450 --> 07:37.050
[Study Camp - 1]

103
07:50.530 --> 07:52.360
[Morning, Hioki]

104
07:52.360 --> 07:56.160
[You okay? Are your bags heavy?]

105
07:56.160 --> 07:58.360
[I can come get you at the gates]

106
08:00.390 --> 08:02.590
He's so fussy sometimes.

107
08:04.450 --> 08:06.760
Hioki!

108
08:10.620 --> 08:13.710
Dude, what's with all the baggage?

109
08:13.710 --> 08:17.180
It's so heavy... lend me your shoulder.

110
08:18.550 --> 08:21.020
- Get off. - No! No!

111
08:21.020 --> 08:24.090
I've got vitamins, and my mom's love

112
08:24.090 --> 08:26.120
- all packed in here... - Hioki.

113
08:26.120 --> 08:27.530
Oh.

114
08:27.530 --> 08:30.420
I told you I'd come get you.

115
08:30.420 --> 08:31.850
Here, I'll carry that.

116
08:31.850 --> 08:33.700
- It's fine. - I insist.

117
08:33.700 --> 08:35.070
Thanks.

118
08:35.070 --> 08:36.400
- And mine? - What about your backpack?

119
08:36.400 --> 08:38.100
I'll carry that myself.

120
08:38.100 --> 08:40.360
Hey!

121
08:40.360 --> 08:41.520
Over here!

122
08:41.520 --> 08:44.150
Let's go.

123
08:44.150 --> 08:46.530
What about mine?

124
08:46.530 --> 08:47.620
- Morning. - Excited?

125
08:47.620 --> 08:48.740
Yeah.

126
08:48.740 --> 08:49.760
They're here.

127
08:49.760 --> 08:51.930
- Morning. - Morning!

128
08:51.930 --> 08:55.540
Were our bus seats assigned?

129
08:55.540 --> 08:57.960
Well, we're allowed to sit wherever, but...

130
08:57.960 --> 08:59.770
Hioki, let's sit together.

131
08:59.770 --> 09:01.760
Sure.

132
09:01.760 --> 09:03.130
Sorry, no can do.

133
09:03.130 --> 09:05.400
- Hioki's riding with us. - Huh?

134
09:05.400 --> 09:08.120
The buses are divvied by class.

135
09:08.120 --> 09:09.580
Hioki's with us.

136
09:09.580 --> 09:11.080
Oh, I see.

137
09:11.080 --> 09:13.500
- Come on, let's go. - Yeah.

138
09:13.500 --> 09:15.150
Hioki.

139
09:16.690 --> 09:18.530
See you later.

140
09:18.530 --> 09:19.530
Yeah.

141
09:19.530 --> 09:21.600
- Come on. - Let's go!

142
09:24.000 --> 09:26.110
Let's get on our bus, too.

143
09:45.290 --> 09:49.090
Tsujitani's quiz!

144
09:49.090 --> 09:53.200
So, how are things going?

145
09:53.200 --> 09:54.390
Huh?

146
09:54.390 --> 09:56.250
You know,

147
09:56.250 --> 09:57.530
with your boyfriend.

148
09:57.530 --> 09:59.280
Why ask?

149
09:59.280 --> 10:02.050
Trips like this are made for talking romance!

150
10:02.050 --> 10:04.970
So, isn't there anything that worries you?

151
10:04.970 --> 10:07.870
Not really. Nothing's changed between us.

152
10:07.870 --> 10:10.850
But you're in separate classes now.

153
10:10.850 --> 10:13.060
You don't feel anxious at all?

154
10:13.060 --> 10:14.660
Not really.

155
10:14.660 --> 10:15.970
Of course I am.

156
10:15.970 --> 10:17.610
I'm full of anxiety.

157
10:17.610 --> 10:21.120
Why? You meet each other between classes every day.

158
10:21.120 --> 10:25.630
Yeah, but that's never enough.

159
10:25.630 --> 10:30.060
I could be with him 24/7, 365 days a year,

160
10:30.060 --> 10:31.220
and still want more.

161
10:31.220 --> 10:33.560
You're being way too selfish.

162
10:35.140 --> 10:36.940
How often do you text?

163
10:36.940 --> 10:38.730
Every day.

164
10:38.730 --> 10:41.160
I always start the conversation though.

165
10:42.680 --> 10:46.780
So, I'm not really worried about anything.

166
10:46.780 --> 10:49.640
You're naive, Hioki.

167
10:49.640 --> 10:50.690
Huh?

168
10:50.690 --> 10:54.860
Dating isn't the end goal of romance, okay?

169
10:56.860 --> 10:59.030
He makes a fair point.

170
10:59.030 --> 11:01.320
What's important is what comes after.

171
11:01.320 --> 11:02.660
Exactly.

172
11:02.660 --> 11:06.780
Don't let your guard down just because feelings are mutual.

173
11:06.780 --> 11:08.210
You never know,

174
11:08.210 --> 11:10.910
Watarai may be full of worries.

175
11:13.950 --> 11:16.190
You think?

176
11:33.900 --> 11:35.490
Hioki!

177
11:37.140 --> 11:39.240
You okay? Tired?

178
11:39.240 --> 11:41.210
Nah, I'm fine.

179
11:44.690 --> 11:48.610
I guess Watarai is a bit overprotective...

180
11:48.610 --> 11:49.990
There, perfect.

181
11:49.990 --> 11:51.480
- Thanks. - Sure.

182
11:51.480 --> 11:52.600
- I want that one. - This one?

183
11:52.600 --> 11:54.750
No, the other one.

184
11:55.520 --> 11:56.770
Hey, guys.

185
11:56.770 --> 11:58.260
Let's take a selfie here.

186
11:58.260 --> 12:00.300
- Good idea. - Yeah.

187
12:00.300 --> 12:01.350
I'm down.

188
12:01.350 --> 12:04.230
Okay, gather around.

189
12:04.230 --> 12:05.270
Ready?

190
12:05.270 --> 12:09.380
- What sort of cheese? - Say, gorgonzola!

191
12:09.380 --> 12:10.670
You sure do love your cheeses.

192
12:10.670 --> 12:12.650
Let me see.

193
12:12.650 --> 12:15.480
- Let's take one together, too. - Sure.

194
12:15.480 --> 12:16.870
A bit too bright, isn't it?

195
12:16.870 --> 12:19.160
- Yeah... - Should we get another one?

196
12:19.160 --> 12:22.350
- Let's just get a trio shot. - Say cheese.

197
12:25.800 --> 12:27.420
You look cute.

198
12:29.550 --> 12:33.670
He really doesn't seem worried.

199
12:33.670 --> 12:35.200
Let's go join them.

200
12:37.150 --> 12:38.520
This almost feels nostalgic.

201
12:38.520 --> 12:40.230
Right?

202
12:40.230 --> 12:42.460
I can't wait for camp.

203
12:42.460 --> 12:46.260
Yeah, everything's going great.

204
12:46.940 --> 12:50.480
Hey, can I post our selfie to Insta?

205
12:50.480 --> 12:53.860
Sure, just make sure to cover Hioki's face.

206
12:53.860 --> 12:56.170
Huh? Why?

207
12:56.170 --> 12:59.760
I don't want anyone else looking at Hioki.

208
12:59.760 --> 13:02.300
He's too cute.

209
13:02.300 --> 13:04.380
Besides...

210
13:04.380 --> 13:07.230
It'd be trouble if anyone like me found him.

211
13:18.800 --> 13:20.130
- Hioki. - Yes?

212
13:20.130 --> 13:23.510
Can I get a selfie?

213
13:23.510 --> 13:24.990
Huh?

214
13:25.780 --> 13:26.920
Right, with Watarai.

215
13:26.920 --> 13:29.440
No. With you.

216
13:29.440 --> 13:31.350
Huh? Me?

217
13:31.350 --> 13:33.900
Yeah. Come on!

218
13:35.000 --> 13:36.160
Ready?

219
13:36.160 --> 13:38.870
- Say cheese... - Wait.

220
13:39.720 --> 13:42.920
Can't the selfie be with me?

221
13:51.410 --> 13:55.600
You're so lucky!

222
13:55.600 --> 13:58.540
I'm jealous!

223
13:58.540 --> 14:01.230
So, why'd you step in?

224
14:01.940 --> 14:03.800
No big reason.

225
14:03.800 --> 14:04.890
I was just messing with her.

226
14:04.890 --> 14:07.500
You were clearly jealous.

227
14:07.500 --> 14:10.120
Is it that bad if Hioki gets popular?

228
14:10.870 --> 14:12.990
Not exactly.

229
14:13.820 --> 14:17.020
And I know I'm being selfish.

230
14:17.020 --> 14:19.460
But I want to be his one and only.

231
14:20.910 --> 14:23.130
While we're at it,

232
14:23.130 --> 14:26.030
Hioki, you need to be more careful.

233
14:26.030 --> 14:27.330
Huh?

234
14:27.330 --> 14:29.150
You're way too vulnerable.

235
14:29.150 --> 14:30.550
Keep your guard up.

236
14:30.550 --> 14:34.260
You don't understand how cute you are.

237
14:36.250 --> 14:37.240
Yes, sir.

238
14:37.240 --> 14:41.970
Once we get to camp, don't leave my side, okay?

239
14:43.800 --> 14:45.110
Okay.

240
14:57.850 --> 15:00.600
Excuse me.

241
15:00.600 --> 15:03.890
Morning exercise? What a drag...

242
15:03.890 --> 15:05.740
No way.

243
15:05.740 --> 15:07.130
[Kazamino High School]

244
15:07.130 --> 15:08.800
[Study Camp Schedule]

245
15:08.800 --> 15:11.750
I see. [Classes 1, 2, 3 - Classes 4, 5, 6]

246
15:11.750 --> 15:16.680
So, dining and bathing are separated by class.

247
15:16.680 --> 15:18.460
In other words,

248
15:18.460 --> 15:20.170
these two are completely apart, huh?

249
15:20.170 --> 15:23.110
[Classes 1, 2, 3 - Classes 4, 5, 6]

250
15:23.110 --> 15:26.430
Look. Watarai's in despair.

251
15:29.340 --> 15:31.040
You okay?

252
15:31.870 --> 15:34.020
No.

253
15:35.450 --> 15:37.990
Hioki, promise you won't talk to anyone else today?

254
15:37.990 --> 15:41.300
That's a tall ask.

255
15:45.750 --> 15:47.610
But I'll do my best.

256
15:48.860 --> 15:50.590
Thank you.

257
16:04.340 --> 16:08.260
Watarai looked super depressed.

258
16:09.880 --> 16:12.500
We'll take a quick break here.

259
16:12.500 --> 16:15.970
Anyone who needs to use the restroom, now's your chance.

260
16:16.700 --> 16:19.750
Sir. Is this something we'll be turning in?

261
16:19.750 --> 16:21.530
Of course.

262
16:21.530 --> 16:23.930
- What'd you expect? - Harsh...

263
16:23.930 --> 16:28.080
But why does he get so worried?

264
16:28.080 --> 16:32.560
[Kazami High Study Camp]

265
16:36.080 --> 16:38.420
I'm nowhere close to being finished!

266
16:39.420 --> 16:41.440
Huh? Where's Hioki?

267
16:41.440 --> 16:44.770
The bathroom, probably.

268
16:50.060 --> 16:54.090
Even if we're apart, it's not like our feelings are going to change.

269
16:55.830 --> 16:57.590
[Toilet]

270
16:58.430 --> 17:00.310
I just don't know...

271
17:00.310 --> 17:02.770
Yeah, if my boyfriend was like that, I'd be down too.

272
17:02.770 --> 17:05.780
Right? We're dating, but everything feels so one-sided.

273
17:05.780 --> 17:09.050
I'm the only one texting and reaching out to him.

274
17:09.050 --> 17:11.710
He doesn't even say he loves me!

275
17:11.710 --> 17:14.540
I just don't know if he cares anymore.

276
17:14.540 --> 17:16.830
It makes me so anxious!

277
17:16.830 --> 17:18.540
Wait a second.

278
17:18.540 --> 17:20.420
So, here's the thing.

279
17:20.420 --> 17:25.520
Am I the one making Watarai anxious?

280
17:25.520 --> 17:28.830
Hioki, I swear...

281
17:40.110 --> 17:41.760
What's up?

282
17:41.760 --> 17:43.440
You've been spacing out.

283
17:43.440 --> 17:45.830
Nothing really.

284
17:45.830 --> 17:48.400
Aw man, my necktie's all tangled.

285
17:48.400 --> 17:49.810
Oh no.

286
17:49.810 --> 17:51.510
What?

287
17:52.630 --> 17:54.550
I forgot my clothes in my room.

288
17:54.550 --> 17:56.060
What?

289
17:56.060 --> 17:57.300
Your shirt, or jersey?

290
17:57.300 --> 17:59.010
Both.

291
17:59.010 --> 18:01.310
I can't believe it.

292
18:01.310 --> 18:03.380
Damn.

293
18:03.380 --> 18:07.070
Then here,

294
18:07.070 --> 18:09.940
- I guess you can use mine. - Seriously?

295
18:09.940 --> 18:14.350
"World's strongest man, Tsujitani!"

296
18:20.540 --> 18:22.270
Thanks.

297
18:25.500 --> 18:26.870
Wait a second.

298
18:26.870 --> 18:29.710
If Watarai found out...

299
18:29.710 --> 18:31.720
Never mind. I'll wear my uniform.

300
18:31.720 --> 18:33.070
Hey, don't be shy.

301
18:33.070 --> 18:35.110
- Seriously, I'm fine. - Wear this.

302
18:35.110 --> 18:37.700
- And then cheer up, yeah? - No thanks.

303
18:37.700 --> 18:40.310
What gives?

304
18:41.390 --> 18:43.010
No, don't tell me.

305
18:43.010 --> 18:44.110
- Did you gain weight? - No.

306
18:44.110 --> 18:46.030
- Can't fit my size? - No.

307
18:46.030 --> 18:47.650
- I didn't notice! - I said, you're wrong.

308
18:47.650 --> 18:51.280
Then what? You won't wear the jersey of a commoner like me?

309
18:51.280 --> 18:53.420
Just cause you're a bit popular now...

310
18:53.420 --> 18:55.190
What?

311
18:57.000 --> 18:59.440
I'm so sad!

312
18:59.440 --> 19:00.400
You have it all wrong.

313
19:00.400 --> 19:01.860
- So sad! - You're wrong.

314
19:02.560 --> 19:04.600
- So, so sad! - You're wrong.

315
19:04.600 --> 19:05.670
Sad!

316
19:05.670 --> 19:07.370
Tsujitani!

317
19:07.370 --> 19:10.870
[World's strongest man, Tsujitani]

318
19:12.550 --> 19:15.840
Whatever. It's only until we get back to our rooms.

319
19:15.840 --> 19:19.030
So long as Watarai doesn't catch us...

320
19:19.030 --> 19:20.640
Hioki!

321
19:26.440 --> 19:27.950
I'll head back first.

322
19:27.950 --> 19:30.020
- Here, I'll grab your stuff. - Hey!

323
19:30.020 --> 19:32.660
Enjoy yourselves!

324
19:37.960 --> 19:40.350
What're you doing?

325
19:40.350 --> 19:42.130
Nothing.

326
19:48.210 --> 19:51.200
[World's strongest man, Tsujitani]

327
19:51.200 --> 19:53.200
I'm done for.

328
19:55.990 --> 19:57.060
Why are you wearing this?

329
19:57.060 --> 20:00.060
I forgot my clothes in my room.

330
20:00.060 --> 20:02.730
I tried turning him down, but...

331
20:04.760 --> 20:07.170
I'll change as soon as I get to my room.

332
20:14.140 --> 20:15.730
Sorry.

333
20:17.090 --> 20:18.850
Are you mad?

334
20:21.190 --> 20:22.800
Come with me.

335
20:26.300 --> 20:28.140
Hey!

336
20:39.290 --> 20:40.900
Watarai?

337
20:42.110 --> 20:43.810
Take it off.

338
20:47.980 --> 20:50.320
Uh...

339
20:50.320 --> 20:54.940
Wait, you aren't wearing anything underneath?

340
21:04.380 --> 21:07.040
You seriously need to be more careful.

341
21:08.850 --> 21:10.480
Sorry.

342
21:13.490 --> 21:18.900
Hioki. Do you realize how much I'm always holding back?

343
21:18.900 --> 21:20.440
Huh?

344
21:50.400 --> 21:52.020
But...

345
21:54.520 --> 21:57.030
I don't have to hold back anymore, right?

346
22:13.080 --> 22:15.200
Wait!

347
22:18.650 --> 22:20.470
I can't wait.

348
22:25.570 --> 22:28.070
Since I'm your boyfriend,

349
22:28.070 --> 22:30.080
can I have my way with you?

350
22:37.670 --> 22:41.050
Day one of study camp.

351
22:42.660 --> 22:47.390
Things are taking an unexpected turn!

352
22:50.410 --> 22:52.480
I love you, Watarai.

353
22:52.480 --> 22:54.480
This takes me back. [Day 2 of camp]

354
22:54.480 --> 22:55.770
Ta-da. [The first birthday they spend together.]

355
22:55.770 --> 22:57.460
Happy birthday. [The first birthday they spend together.]

356
22:57.460 --> 23:01.970
I was happier than I thought.

357
23:01.970 --> 23:05.110
Huh? Tsukasa?

358
23:05.110 --> 23:06.430
Say cheese.

359
23:06.430 --> 23:08.550
Hioki!
